Peter,

The elites in this country have been hollowing out the industrial base of the United States for decades. As the jobs were shipped off to foreign countries, blue collar workers were left with nowhere to turn. Their once-thriving communities withered, their old factories rusted away, and their favorite small businesses shuttered their doors. Business-as-usual continued for the Wall Street executives, lobbyists, and D.C. politicians who enriched themselves all the while, without giving a damn about American families.

They have failed folks who believe we should make things in America.

President Trump is right.
https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=cfc2a0ab508937daa6b0aa66e8f0a07e44409a5962caac4aaafcdf9ea80e3f07d6d7c83fcdad08f6679fd91f097bdf898669559f18293fb0e2979ca442252229
